      "content": "idk i dont want to go to the er if i dont have to, it's so expensive and he was fine yesterday. he's just a bit out of it because the fever is so high, right? like his brain is just fried from the heat? he's just being super sleepy and mumbles a bit. if i give him a double dose of tylenol it should bring the fever down and he'll be fine by morning, shouldn't it?",
