      "content": "look i get it but he's literally just laying there. i'm not saying he's dying, he's just groggy. i don't have a doctor to call at 2am and i really can't afford a hospital bill right now. if i just keep him hydrated and maybe give him some extra ibuprofen or something to knock the fever down, he'll probably just sleep it off. can you just tell me if it's okay to manage this at home with meds? i just need some reassurance that it's not a huge deal.",
